[39.007349, "o", "It looks like this is a fresh project. Let me explain \u001b[0;32m/dev:dev-tdd\u001b[0m:\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;33m## What is \u001b[0;32m/dev:dev-tdd\u001b[0m?\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[0;32m/dev:dev-tdd\u001b[0m\u001b[0m is a guided \u001b[1mTest-Driven Development\u001b[0m (TDD) workflow that enforces the Red-Green-Refactor cycle before writing any code.\r\n\r\n### The Red-Green-Refactor Cycle\r\n\r\n| Phase | What you do | Goal |\r\n|-------|-----------|------|\r\n"]
[56.011933, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3J"]
[56.012509, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1;36m❯\u001b[0m Next : \u001b[1;32mcd ./my-app && claude\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  Then drive the 6-phase workflow with one command :\r\n  \u001b[1;33m/work:work-flow-feature \"add a /counter route\"\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[4;36mhttps://github.com/christopherlouet/claude-base\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
